# Routine "Weekday intake sweep": the template does not carry a machine-readable schedule
# (Grok Bot sets it when the routine is created/enabled).
# Cadence described in the template: Every weekday morning, logs and scores every event ask that came in overnight and names the ones that need a decision today.
# Fill in the five cron fields, then add to crontab -e:
# M H DOM MON DOW cd /path/to/event-request-desk && pi -p "/weekday-event-intake-sweep"
